<title>SINGAPORE: TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the men's Singapore</p>
<p>Open on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) beat 3-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Martin Sinner (Germany) beat Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela) beat Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) 6-1</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat 5-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>4-Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Vince Spadea (U.S.) 7-5 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 6-1</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Dennis Van Scheppingen</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-0 6-3.</p>
</text>
